  "id": "conformity",
  "term": "conformity",
  "definition": "Conformity is the tendency to follow what other people are doing, even in crisis situations where doing so may not help and can sometimes worsen harm. In this context, it refers to people instinctively going along with the crowd rather than acting independently.",
